evidence = PackedStringArray("litter | memo:storm_litter | The storm washed old litter ashore.", "old | memo:storm_old_litter | It even stirred up kinds that had stopped coming, from the sea floor.", "prepared | memo:storm_prepared | What I'd secured came through; what I hadn't was damaged.", "rescue | memo:storm_rescue | It hurt a young animal, and I cared for it until it was strong.", "together | memo:storm_together | The island's people came out and helped me fix what it broke.", "seed | memo:storm_seed | It brought a first tree to an island that had none: a coconut onto the Reef, or willow seeds on the wind to the Polar Ocean.", "water | memo:storm_water | Its rain brought water back to the dry mangrove flats.")
